{"id": "msg_523d07317aa34430bec9e00a83701244", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "找到了。\n\n这个「交易申请」页面（`pages_transaction/newHouseCertification/detail.vue`）点击「确认提交」时，调用的是 `firstHandHouseSubmit`：\n\n- **接口方法**：`POST`\n- **接口路径**：`/transaction/firstHandHouse/submit`\n- **请求实例**：`apiV1`（来自 `@/api/transaction`）\n- **请求体**：整个 `form`，即 `{ contractNumber, securityCode, region, buyerName, idNumber }`\n\n定义位于 [transaction.js:361-363](<zhi2-mobile-shimin/src/api/transaction.js>)。\n\n```js\nexport function firstHandHouseSubmit(data) {\n  return apiV1.post('/transaction/firstHandHouse/submit', data)\n}\n```\n\n页面调用处：`detail.vue` 第 216 行 `firstHandHouseSubmit({ ...this.form })`，根据返回的 `res.result.isCompleted` / `res.result.code` 决定跳转成功页或弹出错误提示（错误码 001–099、ERR-1~3 见页面内 `errors` 映射）。"}], "created_at": "2026-11-04T08:42:26.529Z", "peer_id": "gitlab.zhi.com-zhi-suzhou-shiqu-suzhufang-fe-zhi2-mobile-shimin-h5-zhishu-c-unlimited"}
